# ROVEXO Documentation Master Lock

**STATUS: GLOBAL | MANDATORY | ENTIRE PLATFORM**

## Every module must have

1. Master Engineering Specification
2. Master UI Specification
3. Master UX Specification
4. Master Database Specification
5. Master Performance Specification

## Every page has exactly one status

- REVIEW
- APPROVED
- LOCKED
- FROZEN
- CERTIFIED
- PRODUCTION READY

## Forbidden

- Unknown status
- Multiple official versions
- Undocumented features
- Undocumented database changes
- Undocumented API changes
- Undocumented implementations

## Every change must document

- What changed
- Why it changed
- What was not changed
- Performance impact
- Responsive impact
- Security impact
- Database impact

## No feature may exist without

- Documentation
- Owner approval
- Visual review
- Status assignment

## Final rule

**If it is not documented = it does not exist.**

**Owner approval required.**
